@schedule_congress
title: Begin making arrangements for a proper Congress of Soviets in Kharkiv! 
max-visits: 1
go-to: ukraine_menu
on-arrival: {!
	Q.instability -= 1; 
	Q.democraticitiy -= 5; 
	Q.upr_relation -= 10; 
	Q.ukrainian_congress_timer = 0; 
!}

Our delegates in Kyiv are ordered to head for Kharkiv, where we've begun hastily preparing a new congress. 

@issue_manifesto
title: Issue the Manifesto to the Ukrainian government!
max-visits: 1
go-to: ukraine_menu
on-arrival: {!
  Q.upr_relation -= 30; 
  Q.war_weariness += 1;
  Q.discipline += 0.1; 
  Q.morale += 0.1; 
!}

The Central Rada has rejected our ultimatum, and has issued demands of their own:<br><ul>
	<li>Recognition of the Ukrainian People's Republic.</li>
	<li>Non-interference in the internal affairs of Ukraine and the Ukrainian Front.</li>
	<li>Allowance for Ukrainian military personnel to return to the territory of Ukraine.</li>
	<li>Fair division of the finances of the former Empire between the two nations.</li>
	<li>UPR participation in any peace talks with the Central Powers.</li></ul>Meanwhile, it appears they are preparing their forces for a military confrontation. 

@prepare_army
title: Mobilize the Red Guards, begin preparations for an offensive!
